Description: web-managed NAS operating system
 zendiloOS turns a Debian system into a NAS that is managed through a
 desktop in the web browser.
 .
 ZFS comes from Debian's contrib section and is built for the installed
 kernel (DKMS), which needs the kernel's header package.
 .
 Virtual machines, the App Center's plugin, run on amd64 only for now;
 libvirt and QEMU are suggested there alone.
 .
 This package contains the management service (zendiloosd), the
 privileged agent that carries out root operations on its behalf, the web
 interface and its nginx configuration.
